1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,579
Part seventeen. Expenses, documents and team.

2
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:10,451
Every rupee spent goes into Accounts, Expenses: what it was for,

3
00:00:10,451 --> 00:00:14,389
the category like transport or labour, the amount,

4
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:18,327
the project it belongs to and a photo of the bill.

5
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:25,412
Documents keeps KYC copies, agreements, warranty cards and site photos.

6
00:00:25,412 --> 00:00:31,527
Drop several files at once, or choose them, then give them a category,

7
00:00:31,527 --> 00:00:34,672
the customer and a valid-until date.

8
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:40,965
Category chips filter them, and tapping a card previews photos and PDFs.

9
00:00:40,965 --> 00:00:46,061
You get an alert thirty days before a warranty or agreement expires.

10
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:51,330
Under Team, add your employees with their department,

11
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:57,171
and mark attendance each day: present, absent, half day, leave or late,

12
00:00:57,171 --> 00:00:59,968
with check-in and check-out times.

13
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:06,929
Next video: Lists like a pro: search, filters, views, export.

